{{Quote|I had a wife once. I knew exactly what she was before we got married. We tried to hide it. And the Inquisitors found her anyway. So, I know exactly what the Empire can do.|Kawlan Roken|<ref name="Part IV" />}}
A [[Gender|woman]] was the '''wife''' of the [[human]] operative of the [[Hidden Path]] [[Kawlan Roken]]. She was a fugitive [[Force-sensitive]] during the [[Great Jedi Purge]] in the [[Imperial Era|age]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] and was hunted down<ref name="Part IV" /> and [[Death|killed]]<ref name="Dawn">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> by the [[Inquisitor]]s of the Empire's [[Inquisitorius]].<ref name="Part IV" />

